    {
      "id": "s1",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "Some plays are so successful that they run for years on end.",
      "translation": "有些剧目非常成功，以致连续演出好几年。",
      "startTime": 17.32,
      "endTime": 22.4,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "run",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "连续演出，运转"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "In many ways, this is unfortunate for the poor actors who are required to go on repeating the same lines night after night.",
      "translation": "在很多方面，这对可怜的演员们来说是不幸的，因为他们被要求夜复一夜地重复同样的台词。",
      "startTime": 22.41,
      "endTime": 32.96,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "unfortunate",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "不幸的"
          },
          {
            "word": "lines",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "台词"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "One would expect them to know their parts by heart and never have cause to falter.",
      "translation": "人们本以为他们能熟记自己的台词，绝不会有结巴的时候。",
      "startTime": 32.97,
